    <h2 id="segmented-control">Segmented Control</h2>
    <p>Button group for switching between views or options. The bare <code>segmented-control</code> class still works as a legacy alias.</p>

    <%- example(`
      <div class="aqua-segmented-control">
        <button class="active">Icons</button>
        <button>List</button>
        <button>Columns</button>
      </div>
    `) %>

